<title>THAILAND: Krung Thai Bank to pay 1.45 baht H2 div.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai Bank to pay 1.45 baht H2 div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  1.45    vs     1.70</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 1, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 23, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Krung Thai Bank Plc is a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-652-0642)</p>
</text>
